Topshiriq:

1. Signalni yaratish

Oddiy sinusoidal signalni ko'rib chiqamiz:

x(t)=sin(2πf0t)

bu yerda f0 — signal chastotasi.

2. Signalni n amuna olish

Signalni turli namuna olish chastotalarida olish:

fs < 2f0 — namunalar soni kam, aliasing paydo bo'ladi.

fs = 2f0​ — minimal namunalar soni, teoremaga mos.

fs > 2f0 ​ — yaxshi namuna olish, signalni to'liq tiklash mumkin.

3. MATLAB kod namunasi

% Signal parametrlari

f0 = 10;                % Signal chastotasi (Hz)

T = 1;                 % Signal davomiyligi (s)

t = 0:0.0001:T;        % Uzluksiz vaqt vektori

% Uzluksiz signal

x = sin(2*pi*f0*t);

% Namuna olish chastotalari

fs1 = 30;   % fs1 > 2*f0, yaxshi namuna olish

fs2 = 20;  % fs2 = 2*f0, minimal namuna olish

fs3 = 15;   % fs3 < 2*f0, aliasing yuz beradi

% Namuna olish uchun vaqt vektorlar

ts1 = 0:1/fs1:T;

ts2 = 0:1/fs2:T;

ts3 = 0:1/fs3:T;

% Namuna olingan signal

x1 = sin(2*pi*f0*ts1);

x2 = sin(2*pi*f0*ts2);

x3 = sin(2*pi*f0*ts3);

% Grafiklarga chizish

figure;

subplot(3,1,1);

plot(t,x,'b',ts1,x1,'ro-');

title(['Namuna olish: f_s = ', num2str(fs1), ' Hz > 2*f_0']);

xlabel('Vaqt (s)');

ylabel('Amplituda');

legend('Uzluksiz signal','Namuna olingan signal');

subplot(3,1,2);

plot(t,x,'b',ts2,x2,'ro-');

title(['Namuna olish: f_s = ', num2str(fs2), ' Hz = 2*f_0']);

xlabel('Vaqt (s)');

ylabel('Amplituda');

legend('Uzluksiz signal','Namuna olingan signal');

subplot(3,1,3);

plot(t,x,'b',ts3,x3,'ro-');

title(['Namuna olish: f_s = ', num2str(fs3), ' Hz < 2*f_0 (Aliasing)']);

xlabel('Vaqt (s)');

ylabel('Amplituda');

legend('Uzluksiz signal','Namuna olingan signal');

Topshiriq:

Fazasi turlicha bo'lgan ikkita signalni qurib taqqoslang.

